{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Nimillion - The Last Expedition\u2019 is a modern take on retro platformer that revives the golden age of arcade gaming with Metroidvania-style progression and realistic physics-based controls. <br>I\u2019ve built this physics-based platformer for those who crave brutal, yet fair challenges so if this is your jam and you're tired of hand-holding in modern games, this is your ultimate test of skill. It\u2019s not for casual players expecting easy wins. It's a love letter to gamers who grew up on retro challenges and thrive on the rush of overcoming difficult odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/44adca872eee5e39cf24852466046b4a.poster.avif?t=1763378375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/44adca872eee5e39cf24852466046b4a.webm?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/44adca872eee5e39cf24852466046b4a.mp4?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your rocket ship through a vast, physics-simulated world using only its thrusters. No autopilot, no mercy. Every maneuver demands precision, practice, and commitment, turning simple flight into a high-stakes art form that's easy to pick up but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock game-changing abilities like a grappling rope, short boost, protective shield, zero-gravity mode, lasers, and more to expand your exploration arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels available for a perfectly tailored challenge that scales from tough to unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even with upgrades, survival hinges on your reflexes and strategy as you navigate deadly environmental hazards, solve physics puzzles, and outmaneuver or obliterate hostile entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into over 20 hand-crafted levels, including 3 massive open-world zones filled with platforming perils, and dynamic phenomena like winds, waterfalls, gravity fields, and force fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your mastery on global leaderboards with speedruns.<strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACQUIRE NEW ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/cae0bc528a867e57fc260a5a7a5a67bd.poster.avif?t=1763378375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/cae0bc528a867e57fc260a5a7a5a67bd.webm?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/cae0bc528a867e57fc260a5a7a5a67bd.mp4?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock essential tools like a grappling rope, quick booster, zero-gravity mode, lasers, and more to evolve your rocket ship from basic flyer to unstoppable explorer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGING BOSS FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/028e71b9a055914a28e1b39ce6b1623d.poster.avif?t=1763378375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/028e71b9a055914a28e1b39ce6b1623d.webm?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/028e71b9a055914a28e1b39ce6b1623d.mp4?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace for epic, multi-phase encounters against strong foes. Master physics and upgrades to survive these tough boss fights that demand strategy, timing, and unyielding skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVERSE DIFFICULT TERRAINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/371ff4f0c5857c4f0797598bd7d7865c.poster.avif?t=1763378375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/371ff4f0c5857c4f0797598bd7d7865c.webm?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/371ff4f0c5857c4f0797598bd7d7865c.mp4?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous space environments with precision: battle howling winds, cascading waterfalls, erratic gravity fields, dense vegetation, and beyond in this challenging game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE PHYSICS TO YOUR ADVANTAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/8f9bd58c0e0b69f7372b8f9aab71d702.poster.avif?t=1763378375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/8f9bd58c0e0b69f7372b8f9aab71d702.webm?t=1763378375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src